<title>INDIA: India Mata's expectation on 4-yr paper.</title>
<headline>India Mata's expectation on 4-yr paper.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mata Securities said on Friday it expected a cut-off rate of 10.80 to 11.10 percent at Monday's auction of 4-year stock by the government to raise 50 billion rupees.</p>
<p>Mata has prepared the following ready reckoner for the auction results.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>		     IF THE CUT OFF IS AT</p>
<p>		     --------------------</p>
<p>And your</p>
<p>bid is at</p>
<p>  (pct)	    10.80     10.90   11.00    11.10</p>
<p> 10.80		100     100.32  100.64   100.96   YOUR</p>
<p> 10.90		NA	100.00  100.32   100.64   ACQUISITION</p>
<p> 11.00		NA	  NA    100.00   100.32   COST</p>
<p> 11.10		NA	  NA	NA     100.00   WILL BE</p>
<p>NOTE : NA - No Allotment.</p>
<p>	   -- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
